<title>NEW ZEALAND: ICI NZ buys Levene's paint manufacturing business.</title>
<headline>ICI NZ buys Levene's paint manufacturing business.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>ICI New Zealand Ltd on Tuesday said it had bought the paint manufacturing business of Levene Paint Manufacturing Ltd, effective December 2.</p>
<p>Levene Paint Manufacturing makes the Levene brands of decorative, industrial, roadmaking paints and protective coatings, with annual sales in excess of NZ$20 million.</p>
<p>ICI said the acquisition positioned it strongly in New Zealand's decorative paint market.</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
